1
00:00:15,072 --> 00:00:17,312
Dear Dr Know,

2
00:00:17,536 --> 00:00:22,208
Help! There are too many rules in my life!

3
00:00:22,528 --> 00:00:27,312
Every morning, I have to make my bed before breakfast.

4
00:00:27,840 --> 00:00:32,672
I have to hurry to school because I can’t be late for school.

5
00:00:33,216 --> 00:00:38,048
When I’m at school, I mustn’t use my phone in class either.

6
00:00:38,464 --> 00:00:40,848
And I have to wear the uniform.

7
00:00:41,392 --> 00:00:44,976
After school, there are even more rules!

8
00:00:45,152 --> 00:00:48,272
I have to finish my homework first.

9
00:00:48,656 --> 00:00:53,808
I can only play basketball after I practise the piano.

10
00:00:54,064 --> 00:00:57,088
I can’t hang out with my friends on weekdays.

11
00:00:57,552 --> 00:01:00,368
I know some rules are important,

12
00:01:00,624 --> 00:01:04,224
but this is awful! What can I do?

13
00:01:04,608 --> 00:01:06,896
Yours, Alice

